Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO! YAMOO! YAMOO! YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this dualist kingdom looks\Nlike a pretty big place, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding your grandpa is\Nnot going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've got to start somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check out the suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention all duelists, please\Ndisembark in an orderly fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taya, what if one of those security\Nguys finds out we're both stowaways?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We oughta just play it safe and swim back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.53,0:01:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of\Nnowhere, lame brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.69,0:01:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can just try and\Nact normal, we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.81,0:01:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just act cool, act cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool as a cucumber, keep it cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.27,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are our guests here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.57,0:02:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I just had a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to play it cool, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't suspicious at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.23,0:02:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single one of us made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You would never have caught that\Ncold if it wasn't for Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to Exodium!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were the Exodia cards\Nthat my grandpa gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.99,0:02:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.47,0:02:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of our wormy friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like he just\Nslithered his way off the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,boat and is already looking\Nto start some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That slimeball, I'd love to\Nwipe that smirk off his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I would, too, but we don't\Nhave time for Weevil right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, all duelists, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the stairs to meet your host.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:03:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That castle's gotta belong to Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked like Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura? From school?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Again with this Bakura stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.57,0:03:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's two times that I've seen him\Nnow, But he's not there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.53,0:03:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's all in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're on a\Nrescue mission, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, look, that's Weevil Underwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the regional champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.59,0:03:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the runner-up, Rex Raptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's Mikko Tsunami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He was ranked third.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, these are all the\Nbest duelists in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But where's the world champion, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kid beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:03:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,On his own turf, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.89,0:03:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Kaiba was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He was, but not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's supposed to be the kid to beat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please gather around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your benevolent host is\Nanxious to greet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, would I like to get just\Nfive minutes alone with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When next we duel, we shall\Nplay for far higher stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I have found that\Ngiven the proper incentive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone can be made to play my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving this island\Nuntil I save my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what Pegasus has planned for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.59,0:05:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Maximilian Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my great honor and pleasure to\Nwelcome you all to the duelist kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You stand before me, the\Nworld's greatest duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But come tournament's end, only\None shall be crowned king of games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I implore you all to assemble\Nyour dueling decks with care,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,with creativity, and with cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For this competition will test\Nyour skills like never before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,To track your progress in the tournament,\Nyou've each been given a dueling glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You've also been given\Ntwo precious star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You must wager these star chips\Non each duel you compete in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To advance to the final level of competition\Nfor a chance at the $3 million prize,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you must win 10 star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten star chips will\Nadmit you into my castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,where you'll face me in one final duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:06:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If Grandpa's here, I'd bet my dueling\Nclub he's hidden away in that castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.49,0:06:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll never be able to get in\Nthere with all the guards around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.93,0:06:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just going to have to win\Nenough star chips to get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.67,0:06:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be a tournament unlike\Nanything you have ever experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,State-of-the-art dueling arenas\Ncover this entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And intriguing new dueling\Nrules will be in effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I could tell you what these new rules are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.81,0:06:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But what fun would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.89,0:06:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll discover them as you compete,\Nor you won't last very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, play boldly, think\Nstrategically, and duel mercilessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You have one full hour to prepare,\Nboth your cards and yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.05,0:06:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When the skies light up with\Nfireworks, the duels will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The duelists have arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has taken the bait, and\Nthe games are about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything goes according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta win my way into that castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I don't know if\NI can win this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'd be best for you\Nto take your start ship back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.43,0:07:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, you keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little sister's counting on you to\Nwin the tournament's prize money for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gotta steer clear of the\Nmore experienced duelists at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.79,0:07:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's just a matter\Nof working your way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yugi, between your grandpa and my\Nsister, we don't have any room for mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The fireworks! It's starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's your plan, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I might as well stick with Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.09,0:07:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we do have a score to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that him? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, I challenge you\Nto a duel! Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, Weevil's running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are all these moths coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, they're disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fast for a small guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just slow for a big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the whole island's in\Nbounds, he'll keep running all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's Weevil up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wanted to duel with me\Never since we met on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's he running for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say on the boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.93,0:08:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will soon\Nlearn that there are new
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,rules on the island that\Nrequire more strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have something\Nto do with the new rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So I better figure out what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sent the spider to the fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You flew right into my trap. Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you answer for what\Nyou did on the boat, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to find out if you're as good at\Ndueling as you are at running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I simply running away or\Ncleverly weaving you into my web?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire ground is transforming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gigantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.27,0:10:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, these aren't going to\Nbe like the duels back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.53,0:10:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You've just stepped into a hornet's\Nnest, and there's no way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,These giant arenas must be\Nset up all over the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just meet you on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil's a little too cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed that you have\Njust one starship, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means I'll have the pleasure\Nof eliminating you from the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're gone, everyone else's\Nchips will be easy pickings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I take your two first. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be an all-or-nothing\Nmatch for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I risk both my star\Nchips when you only have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have something\Nelse I think you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole Duel Monsters deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you'd risk your grandpa's deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.95,0:10:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.39,0:10:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning all your cards will be an easy\Nway to exterminate you once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Exterminate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Swat that little twerp like a mosquito.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.23,0:11:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, sounds like a duel is\Nabout to start over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Weevil Underwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's the other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy is Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He beat Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I happen to be his\Nbest friend, Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And these two, these two are trespasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I wouldn't be seeing a\NWeevil-Yugi match-up till the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil's the regional champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No new kid's got a chance against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yugi, my adoring public\Nis waiting, so we should begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you like my killer needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to get through\Nmy mammoth graveyard first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This massive monster will match your\Nannoying insect point for point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.61,0:11:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Killer Needle, let's show the\Nmammoth your stinger. Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone after one sting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be allergic. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Both creatures were evenly matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.51,0:12:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have been a stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you begun to figure out yet why I\Nled you all the way to this forest area?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just look around,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,then you will see that this area is an exact\Nreplica of our surrounding environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,One part wasteland and one part forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And who thrives in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest, most powerful\Ninsects rule the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as I play my bugs in the\Nforest area, I get a field power bonus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you just weren't listening\Nwhen Pegasus said that this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,tournament would have exciting new\Nsurprises in store for us Maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,if you were smart enough to\Nsteal the tournament's secret new
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,rules like I did you'd be getting\Na field power bonus instead of me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He cheated he let us here cuz\Nhe knew he'd have an unfair
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:13:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Advantage. Go ahead, call me\Na cheater. You're all just
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,angry that you didn't swipe\Nthe rules yourselves and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,because you didn't little Yugi\Nis about to get stung What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you be laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at your\Nferocious killer needle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! My monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done with my monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My creature was supercharged\Nwith a field power bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But according to this, Yugi's creature\Nsomehow became just as powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my mammoth got a field\Npower bonus from the wasteland area,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,just like your bugs do from the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The field point advantage was\Nsupposed to be mine alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept wondering about something\Non the boat ride here, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were we traveling to some\Nremote island just to duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But as soon as I saw this holographic\Ndisplay grid, it all came together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster has a type of\Nfield that it does best on,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of like a home field advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And what makes this\Nisland so special is that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,it contains every type\Nof field imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.39,0:14:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So when you deliberately\Nled us to this spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.85,0:14:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you were clearly hoping to get\Nsome kind of field advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awfully clever to put it\Nall together like that, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But figuring out one rule won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There are surprises hidden under\Nevery rock, and I know them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't beat him, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let that fleece scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.89,0:14:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bluffing. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's just see how\Nyou handle this bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My Hercules beetle will find a\Nway to crawl under your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I know about\Nthe field power bonus,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.49,0:14:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it's too late to rebuild my deck now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess a combo attack\Nwould be my best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Feral Imp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll add this Horn of the Unicorn\Nso its magic will raise my attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do a lot better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hercules Beetle attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Feral Imp, magic lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's attack didn't\Neven phase that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's screwy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My imp's magic lightning attack\Nshould have destroyed your beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this another trick, Weevil?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought you knew that\Nall monsters with a field
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,power bonus were also resistant\Nto any type of magic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.19,0:15:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And since my Hercules beetle easily\Ndeflected your lightning bolt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.01,0:15:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,he has more than enough power left\Nto destroy your puny feral imp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And continue to eat away\Nat your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even that four-eyed tick's\Nweakest bugs are going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,tough to beat so long as he's\Ngot that field power bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's not exactly\Nlike it can just be turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That weevil's a no-good cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn. Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should use my\Nnext monster to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,By putting my card in defense\Nmode, my monster will take a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But my life points will be spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.35,0:16:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we're defending now, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I can't see your monster's defense\Npoints, I can't be sure I can beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.55,0:16:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But even your strongest monster\Ncan't stand against my basic insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only does he get a field power bonus,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm upgrading him with a level 3\Nlaser cannon and a level 2 power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His insect's so powerful now,\Nmy defense won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And after it falls, my\Nlife points are next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.39,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Yuki, for all the innocent\Nlittle bugs you've squashed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,stumped, crushed, or\Nfumigated, it's payback time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that if you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,hope to survive my bug's\Nlaser-powered arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, another defense card, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll make sure that\Ndefending is all he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep you on the defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now, with any monster, and you\Nwill instantly activate this trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That Weevil's got Yugi cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he can't even counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as my trap card remains in play,\Nyou're powerless to make a move against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So, does my tightening\Nwear make you squirm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so busy bragging, he's not\Npaying any attention to my moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can set a little trap\Nof my own. Face it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you pinned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.33,0:17:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And while you're totally unable to attack\Nme, I can attack you any time I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Each turn you cower, I\Ncreate a new monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep drawing, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My army of insects just\Nkeeps getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wipe out all your\Nmonsters in one bug blitzkrieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Put all your monsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I'm counting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at our Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so confident up there. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.27,0:18:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When he's dueling, it's like he\Nbecomes a totally different guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm down to my last monstrous insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what that means, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to be exterminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see what my cards\Nhave to say about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Dark Magician. This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Weevil can\Nresist him as a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I defend with a Dark Magician. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy your very\Nfavorite card first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my pet, power up your laser cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:18:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:19:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, you're not the only one\Nwho can set a trap card. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so busy grandstanding, you paid\Nno attention to the cards I put into play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought they were all\Nmonster-c-cards! Not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,While you loaded the field with your bug\Nmonsters, I prepared a special surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.53,0:19:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of my Mirror Force Trap Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You already ordered your\Nattack on my Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.73,0:19:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and Mirror Force will\Ndeflect it right back at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My life points are devastated!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He obliterated my army of beautiful bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.93,0:19:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a liar and a cheat, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was your overconfidence that\Nallowed me to get the best of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.97,0:19:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your insects are decimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are low.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.01,0:19:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And as you yourself said before,\Nyou have used up all your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.75,0:19:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I lied about that, too. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:20:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have my most formidable\Ncreature waiting in the wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And this unconquerable insect will\Nswat you down once and for all!
